    <name>Threshold (55min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 5min from 40% to 65% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 65% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 3min 30s @ 81% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 2min 30s @ 95% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 3min 30s @ 81% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 65% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 3min 30s @ 81% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 2min 30s @ 95% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 3min 30s @ 81% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 65% FTP | Cooldown: 3min from 65% to 40% FTP</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
